2. APPLICATION LEARNING MODEL
--------------------------------------------------

Structure learning using this flow:

STORY
↓
LEARN
↓
EXPLORE
↓
PRACTISE
↓
CHALLENGE
↓
FEEDBACK
↓
REWARD
↓
REVIEW

Every topic should have a short learning journey.

Example:

Topic:
Adab Dengan Ibu Bapa

Stage 1 — Story

Show a short illustrated scenario:

"Aiman pulang dari sekolah dan melihat ibunya sedang membawa barang yang banyak..."

Let the child follow the story.

Stage 2 — Think

Ask:

"Apakah yang patut Aiman lakukan?"

Allow the child to make a choice.

Stage 3 — Learn

Explain the Islamic value or concept using simple child-friendly language.

Stage 4 — Practice

Provide 3–5 simple questions.

Stage 5 — Challenge

Provide a mini quiz.

Stage 6 — Reward

Award:

XP
stars
coins
badge progress

Stage 7 — Reflection

Example:

"Hari ini saya belajar bahawa..."

Give 2–3 simple selectable reflection statements.

